{
 "file": "script/ENG/message/ko/3p/ko_.bmg",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}Hey, {ff 00 00 06}{01 00 00 05 00}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\nYou ever thought about\ngetting married?{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}So, {01 00 00 05 00}{ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}...{01 00 00 0f 00}\nHow's the patrol coming\nalong, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 0e 00}Hmmm. {01 00 00 0f 00}No offense, man,\nI think I'm a bit more\nmanly than you{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 15 00}Me? What about you,\n{ff 00 00 06}{01 00 00 05 00}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}?{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 0e 00}Naw{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 14 00}Heh.{01 00 00 05 00} Me neither{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}Yeah, it's nothin' but a\nbunch of hogwash if you\nask me{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\nBut{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.living the rest of\nour lives alone is sorta{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{07 04 00}depressing, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 16 00}Yeah,{01 00 00 05 00} I guess you're right.{01 00 00 14 00}\nIt IS a little depressing,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.\n{07 0b 00}But don't we talk about\nthis{01 00 00 05 00} every time we run\ninto each other?{07 00 00}{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 15 00}I guess the real question\nis, which of us will escape\nthe bachelor life first?\nMay the best man win,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.{03 03 00 01}{09 02 00}{03 03 00 01}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 15 00}Better than ever!{01 00 00 14 00}\nIt's what I do best, though,\nso I'm not surprised.\n{07 00 00}{ff 00 00 06}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00},{01 00 00 0f 00} how are things\non your end, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 14 00}Great on this side too!{01 00 00 14 00}\nFor now, {04 03 00} is a\npeaceful place!\n{07 11 00}I think it's safe to say{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\nthat it's all thanks to you\nand me! {01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 13 00}Yeah, I think we both\ndeserve pats on the\nback, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{03 01 00 01}{09 01 00}{03 01 00 01}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 15 00}Did you fall on your head or\nsomething?{01 00 00 0f 00} Everybody\nknows I'm the manliest.{09 01 00}{07 00 00}{09 02 00}\n{07 00 00}And on top of that, I look\nway younger, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 15 00}Hey now! Now I KNOW you're\ntalkin' crazy, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\n\nJust because you look a\nlittle like me, {07 01 00}don't be\ngettin' a big head!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 01 00}Oh no, you've got that all\nbackward!{01 00 00 14 00} You're the one\nthat looks like me!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 15 00}So{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} If I called you ugly,\nwhat would that make me?{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 00 00}Well, {ff 00 00 06}{01 00 00 05 00}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}, {01 00 00 0f 00}I guess\nthat'd make us both ugly.\n\n{07 15 00}But that's ridiculous!\nEveryone knows we're the\nbest looking, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}Yeah{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 01 00} You're so right.\n{01 00 00 05 00}Even if we are a little\ngrumpy.{03 03 00 01}{09 01 00}{03 03 00 01}",
   "et": ""
  }
 ]
}
